00:29:05.830 --> 00:29:06.350
Awesome.

00:29:06.350 --> 00:29:09.390
So that concludes
the first demo.

00:29:09.390 --> 00:29:10.411
You can clap.

00:29:10.411 --> 00:29:13.297
